      "message": "Oh, except because chromeos-base/ec-devutils uprevs are managed by PUpr, while dev-util/hdctools is uprev\u0027d by the regular cros_workon process.  I doubt there\u0027s any possibility of getting a lockstep automatic uprev in a single commit. 😞\n\nIn theory you could probably do a combined manual uprev, but I don\u0027t think that is worthwhile.  Short of that, https://crrev.com/c/4966522/2 is probably as good as this can get, just update the description as mentioned there.\n\n[ I\u0027m marking this thread resolved. ]",
