      "side": 1,
      "message": "Re-opening this since the CL ordering does matter and the Cq-Depend loop should still be avoided.\n\nI think the safe ordering for avoiding build and uprev breakage is:\n\n1. CL:4892017 (this CL deleting servo_updater from platform/ec/)\n2. CL:4966522 (the ebuild CL)\n3. CL:4879103 (adding servo_updater to hdctools)\n\nMake the Cq-Depends require that ordering, as pure one way dependency path (no loops).\n\nFeel free to send them all to CQ together once fully approved.  This is just so CQ will follow a defined, safest ordering in case any of the merges fails.",
